Hi, do you remember me?
I am Emmet.{be01}
I am a Subway Boss.{be01}
I like Double Battles.{be01}
I like combinations of
two Pokémon.{be01}
And I like winning
more than anything else.{be01}
This time, I am really serious.
Really serious.{be01}
Because if a battle is not serious,
it is not fun.

I am Emmet.{be01}
I won against you.
But this is not the end.{be01}
I am sure you will show up
here again.{be01}
I will wait for it and
win against you again.{be01}
Because I am a
Subway Boss. I am Emmet.

I am Emmet.{be01}
I am a Subway Boss,
but I lost against you again.{be01}
But I feel good.
Because it was very fun!{be01}
You want to win, and
I don't want to lose.{be00}
That's real.{be01}
When we clash in battles,
I feel very excited!
